{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/400711-help-this-fledgling-play-in-his-first-vampire-game","id":400711,"title":"Help this Fledgling play in his first Vampire game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-10T12:43:23-08:00","id":400711,"title":"Help this Fledgling play in his first Vampire game","content":"Hello all,<br /> <br /> I am a recent convert to the World of Darkness and given the chance would love to play in an online game.<br /> <br /> I have been aware of the World of Darkness for quite some time now but only started becoming more and more interested in the last couple of years. It was due to all the new products Onyx Path were putting out and when I bought Blood and Smoke: the Strix Chronicle and Mummy the Curse that was when I become hooked. I am now a proud backer of both Deluxe V20 Dark Ages and the ongoing World of Darkness Dark Eras Prestige Edition.<br /> <br /> I am new to the World of Darkness but not new to role-playing. I have been playing pen and paper RPGs on and off for the last 13 years, and for the last two years I have been playing play-by-post as I really enjoy the creative writing experience. I have also played via Skype chat but have struggled with it due to the time differences.<br /> <br /> But despite all this, I still haven't had a chance to play in any World of Darkness game, and I thought it was high time I did something about that!<br /> <br /> So if anyone is recruiting for a game, I'd love the chance to be able to play in your chronicle. Beggars cannot be choosers but if I was allowed a preference for my first game it would be a Vampire: The Requiem game and a period one at that as I love history! I am also very intrigued by Mummy: The Curse and Demon: The Descent, but in the end I am quite willing to try any of the World of Darkness lines. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Kind regards,<br /> <br /> Raven<br /> <br /> P.s Apologies for the long winded introduction but I couldn't find an appropriate forum to introduce myself to the community.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5012,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5012-raven-of-the-tower","user":"Raven of the Tower","date":". 02-10-2015, 03:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5012-raven-of-the-tower","name":"Raven of the Tower","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5012_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T22:33:09-08:00","id":403040,"title":"","content":"Would you be interested in a V20 game? I am hoping to get a group together and you would be welcome to play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1090-tobias","name":"Tobias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1090_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-11T23:05:57-08:00","id":403068,"title":"","content":"Hey Tobias,<br /> <br /> I'd be very willing to participate in a Vampire: The Masquerade game! Keep me posted, and I will make sure I get my hands on a copy of V20.<br /> <br /> Kind Regards,<br /> <br /> Raven","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5012-raven-of-the-tower","name":"Raven of the Tower","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5012_2.